B.aWR=new A.w3("forest_rangers","Klub lesn\xedch str\xe1\u017ec\u016f","Tajemstv\xed star\xe9 vrby","od 6 let","cca 15 min","Ve star\xe9 vrb\u011b se ukr\xfdv\xe1 tajn\xe1 klubovna a je\u0161t\u011b tajn\u011bj\u0161\xed vzkaz. P\u0159idej se k Markovi, Tereze a Karlovi a vydej se po stop\xe1ch stolet\xe9 legendy. Stihnete to do z\xe1padu slunce?","assets/images/stories/forest_rangers_cover.webp","assets/images/stories/forest_rangers_card.webp","Lesn\xed str\xe1\u017eci","V\xedtej mezi lesn\xedmi str\xe1\u017eci!")
B.aWQ=new A.w3("museum","Tajemn\xe9 muzeum","P\u016flno\u010dn\xed kl\xed\u010d","od 8 let","cca 40 min","Jak\xe9 to asi je z\u016fstat v muzeu p\u0159es noc? Kdy\u017e zhasnou sv\u011btla, v\u0161ichni odejdou dom\u016f a jste ve tm\u011b \xfapln\u011b sami\u2026 Nebo ne tak \xfapln\u011b?\n\nMuzeum po setm\u011bn\xed \u017eije vlastn\xedm \u017eivotem a vy m\xe1te jedine\u010dnou p\u0159\xedle\u017eitost zjistit, co v\u0161echno se v jeho temn\xfdch z\xe1kout\xedch skr\xfdv\xe1.\n\nNezapome\u0148te si s sebou vz\xedt bystrou hlavu a trochu odvahy. Budete pot\u0159ebovat oboj\xed.",u.N,u.N,"Tajemn\xe9 muzeum","Muzeum je znovu otev\u0159en\xe9.")
